{
  "name": "Blood Curse of the Anxious",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you harry the body or mind of a creature you can see within 30 feet of you, making them susceptible to mental influence. Until the end of your next turn, Charisma (Intimidation) checks made against the cursed creature have Advantage and whenever the target takes psychic damage, it takes additional damage of the same type equal to a roll of your hemocraft die.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> The next Wisdom Saving Throw the cursed creature makes before this curse ends has Disadvantage.</p>",
